DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The mmaalllloocc__ssttaattss() function prints (on standard error) statistics about
       memory  allocated  by  mmaalllloocc(3) and related functions.  For each arena
       (allocation area), this function prints the total amount of memory  al‐
       located  and  the total number of bytes consumed by in‐use allocations.
       (These two values correspond to the _a_r_e_n_a and _u_o_r_d_b_l_k_s fields retrieved
       by mmaalllliinnffoo(3).)  In addition, the function prints the sum of these two
       statistics for all arenas, and the maximum number of blocks  and  bytes
       that were ever simultaneously allocated using mmmmaapp(2).

